   Description: Edit profile form dialog with input field, labels, and full-width save button
   Dependencies: ButtonCn, DialogCn, DialogContentCn, DialogDescriptionCn, DialogFooterCn, DialogHeaderCn, DialogTitleCn, DialogTriggerCn, InputCn, LabelCn
